{"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.059670778910319022,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Test 8","x":0.86213991908393517,"y":0.062426383825478937},{"t":"One of the major problems in achieving this will be getting architects and town planners to","x":0.082242324643296075,"w":0.71617365519205733,"y":0.10594068474159735,"h":0.016333269988690113,"c":1},{"x":0.83539094732145447,"w":0.039094648361206019,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"Q37","y":0.10755813935581882},{"t":"use the research. Apart from studying the basics of acoustics, these people receive very","c":1,"h":0.017486374004709981,"x":0.082236551664855231,"y":0.12064599263889253,"w":0.70385737101236978},{"x":0.080246911279310024,"y":0.13808139521618623,"w":0.73662551879882809,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"little training in this area. But in fact they should be regarding sound as an opportunity to add"},{"h":0.018063816501900476,"c":1,"x":0.080164355135671606,"y":0.15193884248740042,"w":0.72444061279296879,"t":"to the experience of urban living, whereas at present they tend to see it as something to be"},{"h":0.018751398834659816,"x":0.080159301795880919,"y":0.16634008979304793,"c":1,"w":0.71212397257486981,"t":"avoided or reduced as far as possible, or something that's just a job for engineers like the"},{"t":"street drainage system.","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.19341564178466797,"x":0.08024691150272778,"y":0.18459302312953929},{"x":0.08016872348334203,"c":1,"t":"What's needed is for noise in cities to be regarded as an aesthetic quality, as something","y":0.20579908247965228,"w":0.69974543253580734,"h":0.017087733647286996},{"x":0.080133921453771059,"t":"that has the qualities of an art form. If we acknowledge this, then we urgently need to","w":0.67716506958007816,"y":0.22059360613344403,"h":0.018615970903627987,"c":1},{"h":0.016367742675493679,"x":0.080174033407555023,"w":0.71413614908854162,"c":1,"y":0.23685442004419965,"t":"know what governs it and how designers can work with it. We need to develop a complex"},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q38","y":0.23982558125665687,"x":0.83539094709955064,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.25290697660600059,"t":"understanding of many factors. What is the relationship between sound and culture? What","x":0.080246922191277673,"w":0.72016459147135414,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"w":0.71207412719726559,"h":0.016832596562074476,"x":0.080175438932847953,"c":1,"t":"can we learn from disciplines such as psychology about the way that sound interacts with","y":0.26796797147533358},{"x":0.080246902174272827,"c":1,"t":"human development and social relationships, and the way that sound affects our thought and","y":0.28474676068395954,"w":0.74074076334635408,"h":0.016195524146054296},{"y":0.29941860451798852,"x":0.078189297790024218,"w":0.62757202148437496,"t":"feelings? Can we learn anything from physics about the nature of sound itself?","c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q39","x":0.83333333393687814,"c":1,"y":0.30087209286482264,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"t":"Today's powerful technologies can also help us. To show us their ideas and help us to","y":0.32267441847123002,"x":0.080246919728103314,"w":0.68106994628906259,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"h":0.016036308275094724,"c":1,"x":0.07818929771927903,"w":0.79423868815104148,"y":0.33716136628355309,"t":"imagine the effect their buildings will have, architects and town planners already use virtual. Q40"},{"x":0.078093866568360301,"w":0.68332494099934904,"y":0.35158384614162363,"h":0.018467018545305747,"t":"reality - but these programs are silent. In the future such programs could use realistic","c":1},{"h":0.01702907593708014,"t":"sounds, meaning that soundscapes could be explored before being built. So hopefully, using","c":1,"w":0.73673029581705718,"x":0.078139088806070733,"y":0.3681722316936612},{"t":"the best technology we can lay our hands on, the city of the future will be a pleasure to the","y":0.38515901085955884,"c":1,"w":0.71810699462890626,"h":0.01309680320910489,"x":0.080246914078363901},{"t":"ears as well as the eyes.","y":0.39798279856262009,"h":0.015432126390077405,"x":0.079987945994081711,"w":0.20019800821940104,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"115","c":1,"y":0.93604651147187856,"x":0.87448559730531183},{"w":0.20851318359374998,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39469720757347232,"h":0.018254359844014467,"y":0.96598359674835832,"c":1}],"w":2400}